<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - DUTCH ECONOMIC INDICATORS WEEK OF JULY 28.</title>
<headline>DIARY - DUTCH ECONOMIC INDICATORS WEEK OF JULY 28.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau</p>
<p>of Statistics (CBS) said on Friday it planned to publish the</p>
<p>following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT----date----indicator------------------period---previous</p>
<p>  0730   28/07   Business confidence index  June     3.3</p>
<p>  0730   28/07   manufacturing</p>
<p>		     capacity utilisation	 June     83.8</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
